  "slug": "local-delivery-freight-claim-intake-form",
  "title": "Local Delivery Freight Claim Intake Form",
  "subtitle": "Build a decision-ready local delivery claim file from shipment identity, observed loss or damage, determinable amounts, preserved evidence, mitigation, requirements review, and accountable investigation routing.",
  "description": "An original, fillable local delivery freight claim intake form for controlling multi-stop local order through freight claim intake identity, observations, evidence, decision, exceptions, escalation, completion, handoff, and final verification without replacing applicable requirements or professional review.",
  "use_case": "Use when alleged loss, damage, delay, or expense involving multi-stop local order must be submitted and triaged without treating an inspection notation, delivery exception, or intake signature as a liability or payment decision.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
