          "guidance": "This local delivery freight claim intake is an operational record, not a substitute for applicable law, contract terms, safety or product requirements, or professional judgment. Stop the affected movement, transfer, release, posting, or disposition when identity, evidence, authorization, or control is uncertain. A qualified local delivery operations lead must review the exception and document the controlling decision."
